      "title": {
        "en": "Firmware Finder",
        "zh": "固件检索"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Ask in natural language or type /firmware to find production firmware, inspect Teambition version-task subtasks as solved/pending, and check bug fixes via commit logs. Lazy per-model retrieval by default.",
